      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Espresso  ->  Double shot in cup\n2. Steam     ->  Microfoam 60-65C\n3. Tap+Swirl ->  Remove big bubbles\n4. HIGH pour ->  Thin stream, fill 1/3\n5. LOW pour  ->  Thick stream, circle\n6. WIGGLE    ->  Widen white circle\n7. PULL      ->  Thin stream through\n8. SERVE     ->  With a smile :)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Espresso  ->  Double shot in cup\n2. Steam     ->  Microfoam 60-65C\n3. Tap+Swirl ->  Remove big bubbles\n4. HIGH pour ->  Thin stream, fill 1/3\n5. LOW pour  ->  Thick stream, circle\n6. WIGGLE    ->  Widen white circle\n7. PULL      ->  Thin stream through\n8. SERVE     ->  With a smile :)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
